==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|m|u}}

===Etymology===
Possibly from a {{etyl|gem|fi}} language, compare {{m|sv|myra}}, or from {{der|fi|ine-pro|*moruiH-}}, compare Russian {{m|ru|мураве́й}}, Ukrainian {{m|uk||мура́ха}}.

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[ant]] {{gloss|insect of the family Formicidae}}
# {{lb|fi|in plural}} The family [[Formicidae]].

